      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY\nPROJECTS COMMISSIONING/FLAG-OFF IN THE FCT\nDay 10 - Wednesday, 25\" June, 2025\n\nCommissioning of the newly constructed interchange bridges of arterial road N20 (Wole Soyinka Way) over Outer Northern Expressway (Murtala Mohammed Expressway) at the Onex interchange bridge Katampe Extension.\n\nAs usual, traffic will be slightly affected at the following points:\n\nA) The service lane-out bound on Murtala Mohammed Expressway also called the Kubwa expressway. Vehicular traffic will be emptied from the service lane into the main carriage way near the Shema Filling Station, approaching the interchange bridges at about 1000hrs.\n\nB) The service lane-inbound the city centre will temporarily be closed to allow ease of exiting of dignitaries after close of event.\n\nC) Traffic connecting Nl6 road towards the new Gishiri bridges might attract high traffic as dignitaries can still exist through the axis.\n\nTraffic control personnel and security agents will be deployed accordingly.\n\nSigned\nHead Traffic, DRTS",
